        "id": 1000407
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-04-30T21:57:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you explain the GPIO and I2C sequence?\n\nWhat about enable is 0, i.e. disable the switchcap? Still doing the GPIO and then I2C?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 110,
        "startChar": 25,
        "endLine": 110,
        "endChar": 31
      },
      "revId": "b66d4151e36d467a5a91fa107ad5cbb02f971141",
